        "4ef77f3f-8879-4f82-841f-d4fbcbf12bb3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Our Process",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_uppercase": true,
            "description": "<p>Our rigorous product development process leaves no stone left unturned. No detail is too small when it comes to product formulation. The Obagi R&D team pours over thousands of ingredients to find the most efficacious ones, then reviews each and every form of these ingredients to identify the highest quality, most bio-available form. They don’t stop there: the team works further to optimize key ingredient concentrations as well as pH to be confident Obagi products can deliver our promise for results you can see and feel.<\/p>",
            "width_content": "50%",
            "content_position": "left",
            "text_align_desktop": "left",
            "text_align_mobile": "center"
          }
        }
      },
